\ud83c\udf93 Attend live sessions and university events\n\ud83c\udf10 Social and collaborative virtual environment\n\ud83d\ude80 Continuous updates and new features planned\n\nSEGi Universe is designed to create a connected, engaging, and innovative digital campus experience, helping students learn, socialize, and collaborate beyond the boundaries of the physical campus.\n\nVersion 1.0 \u2013 Initial Release. More locations, activities, customization options, and student-focused experiences will be added in future updates.", "short_description": "Meet friends, explore campus, and join live sessions in the SEGi Universe."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://segiuniverse.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "GTDD Department", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.segi.edu.my/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "1132943536578280"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1949166526469901"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1949166526469901"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1785459420, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1949166526469901"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1174887905717176", "version": "9.0.0"}, "id": "1475446243907602", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1109694298903204", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1174887905717176"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1475446243907602"}]}, "change_log": "SEGi Universe \u2013 Release Notes (v9.0) We\u2019re excited to launch the first version of SEGi Universe, a metaverse experience designed exclusively for SEGi University students. \ufffd What\u2019s New in Version 9.0 \ufffd Explore SEGi Campus in Virtual Reality Step into a digital version of SEGi University and freely roam around the campus environment in an immersive 3D space. \ufffd Meet & Talk with Friends Connect with classmates and friends in real-time voice chat. Hang out, interact, and build a social experience just like in real life. \ufffd Attend Live Sessions Together Join live lectures, events, and group sessions with friends inside the virtual world. Experience learning in a more interactive and engaging way. \ufffd Social Metaverse Experience A shared virtual space where students can gather, explore, and collaborate in a new digital campus environment. \ufffd Performance & Stability Improved avatar movement responsiveness Optimized networking for smoother multiplayer interaction Reduced latency in voice communication", "created_date": 1785231283, "id": "1174887905717176", "version": "9.0.0", "version_code": 9, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "1174887505717216"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__type